# Project Index Onboarding

If you lack confident project context (new session, new machine, unfamiliar repo):

1. Read `docs/indexing/manifest.md`
2. Read every `docs/indexing/full-indexing-*.md` listed there, in order
3. If missing or clearly stale → run the **index-extractor** skill, then re-read

Use the index for orientation; verify implementation details against source before editing.
